<title>UK: British Airways drops on UBS downgrade.</title>
<headline>British Airways drops on UBS downgrade.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in British Airways Plc fell for a second day on Wednesday as brokerage UBS cut earnings estimates for the current year, dealers said.</p>
<p>British Airways shares dropped 15-1/2p to 612-1/2p by 0814 GMT.</p>
